      "writtenOn": "2023-02-28T21:51:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Refactored the ectool.cc interface to take a address and size. Also refactored to sort and merge the coredump segments so the output is contiguous. PTAL.",
      "parentUuid": "e858ab50_0154d2af",
      "range": {
