        "id": 1519424
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-08T05:11:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Indeed. I switched to using TASK_ID. This requires some manual maintenance of the non-shimmed task list, but it saves 1.5KB of flash. The extra friction may also help mitigate dumping the wrong thread.",
      "parentUuid": "f7cfc473_b954e9eb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 18,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 18,
        "endChar": 12
